{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"2":"Prayer (Kitab Al-Salat)"},"section_detail":{"2":{"hadithnumber_first":391,"hadithnumber_last":1160,"arabicnumber_first":391,"arabicnumber_last":1160,"name_native":"كتاب الصلاة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":769,"arabicnumber":769,"text":"حَدَّثَنَا الْقَعْنَبِيُّ، عَنْ مَالِكٍ، قَالَ لاَ بَأْسَ بِالدُّعَاءِ فِي الصَّلاَةِ فِي أَوَّلِهِ وَأَوْسَطِهِ وَفِي آخِرِهِ فِي الْفَرِيضَةِ وَغَيْرِهَا ‏.‏","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih Maqtu"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih Maqtu"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":2,"hadith":379}}]}